   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I&#39;m using geom_path with lty=2 to output some dashed lines. When I use ggsave to save the plot as a PNG I get:<div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-_8OOkorVTWk/UhfJZ12Y3gI/AAAAAAAAAEA/zTlrO37kZrk/s1600/Screen+Shot+2013-08-23+at+4.41.18+PM.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-_8OOkorVTWk/UhfJZ12Y3gI/AAAAAAAAAEA/zTlrO37kZrk/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2013-08-23%2Bat%2B4.41.18%2BPM.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792372297025000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2kZYY-Dk0OL1zjGUtoa-6-\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-_8OOkorVTWk/UhfJZ12Y3gI/AAAAAAAAAEA/zTlrO37kZrk/s320/Screen+Shot+2013-08-23+at+4.41.18+PM.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"264\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">And when I save the same plot as a JPG, I get:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-9RbM6UFH510/UhfJiAciQcI/AAAAAAAAAEI/Fe7pqXUAH74/s1600/Screen+Shot+2013-08-23+at+4.42.04+PM.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-9RbM6UFH510/UhfJiAciQcI/AAAAAAAAAEI/Fe7pqXUAH74/s1600/Screen%2BShot%2B2013-08-23%2Bat%2B4.42.04%2BPM.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792372297025000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1KzFYUCBrq1rtoDphTqQiM\"><img src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-9RbM6UFH510/UhfJiAciQcI/AAAAAAAAAEI/Fe7pqXUAH74/s1600/Screen+Shot+2013-08-23+at+4.42.04+PM.png\" border=\"0\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">Both images are saved with identical widths, heights, and DPI (600dpi). Is this a bug?</p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
